      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xuhuo:received_sentence3-189",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "1b7_36b_29b_A",
        "source_quote": "其二曰：「郡領銀民三百餘戶，鑿坑採砂，皆二三丈，功役既苦，不顧崩壓，一歲之中，每有死者。",
        "reading": "其二說銀民三百餘戶、採坑二三丈，每歲有死者。",
        "note": "其二說銀民三百餘戶、採坑二三丈，每歲有死者。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xuhuo:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 189,
        "end_codepoint": 233,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xuhuo:received_sentence3-233",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "1b7_36b_29b_A",
        "source_quote": "官司檢切，猶致逋違，老少相隨，永絕農業，千有餘口，皆資他食，豈唯一夫不耕，或受其饑而已。",
        "reading": "逋逃、廢耕而千餘口資他食。",
        "note": "逋逃、廢耕而千餘口資他食。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xuhuo:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 233,
        "end_codepoint": 277,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xuhuo:received_sentence3-277",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "1b7_36b_29b_A",
        "source_quote": "所以歲有不稔，便致甚困。",
        "reading": "荒年尤其困乏。",
        "note": "荒年尤其困乏。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xuhuo:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 277,
        "end_codepoint": 289,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xuhuo:received_sentence3-289",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "1b7_36b_29b_A",
        "source_quote": "尋臺邸用米，不異於銀，謂宜准銀課米，即事為便。」",
        "reading": "建議以米代銀。",
        "note": "建議以米代銀。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xuhuo:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 289,
        "end_codepoint": 313,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xuhuo:received_sentence3-313",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "1b7_36b_29b_A",
        "source_quote": "其三曰：「中宿縣俚民課銀，一子丁輸南稱半兩。",
        "reading": "第三事記中宿俚民每子丁南稱半兩。",
        "note": "第三事記中宿俚民每子丁南稱半兩。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xuhuo:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 313,
        "end_codepoint": 335,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xuhuo:received_sentence3-335",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "1b7_36b_29b_A",
        "source_quote": "尋此縣自不出銀，又俚民皆巢居鳥語，不閑貨易之宜，每至買銀，為損已甚。",
        "reading": "當地不產銀，買銀難而損耗。",
        "note": "當地不產銀，買銀難而損耗。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xuhuo:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 335,
        "end_codepoint": 369,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xuhuo:received_sentence3-369",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "1b7_36b_29b_A",
        "source_quote": "又稱兩受入，易生姦巧，山俚愚怯，不辨自申，官所課甚輕，民以所輸為劇。",
        "reading": "收銀權衡又易生弊。",
        "note": "收銀權衡又易生弊。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xuhuo:p003",
        "start_codepoint": 369,
        "end_codepoint": 403,
        "human_reviewed": false
      },
      {
        "id": "c-songshu-092-xuhuo:received_sentence3-403",
        "kind": "received_sentence",
        "person_id": "1b7_36b_29b_A",
        "source_quote": "今若聽計丁課米，公私兼利。」",
        "reading": "亦請按丁納米。",
        "note": "亦請按丁納米。",
        "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-092-xuhuo:p003",
